# The build context is the repository root; this keeps it to what the build reads.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.mastra
**/dist
.nx
.git
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.data
**/.credentials
# .seb-bundle is NOT ignored: pnpm install inside the build installs from it. CI installs the locked bundle
# before the build (.github/actions/seb-bundle); without it pnpm tries the registry and gets HTTP 401.
